WEBVTT

00:12:59.213 --> 00:13:00.649
and they are having two a day.

00:13:00.673 --> 00:13:02.228
So, let me just show you.

00:13:02.252 --> 00:13:05.334
We've got one kid, here --

00:13:07.027 --> 00:13:10.839
having, you know,
eight tablespoons of sugar a day.

00:13:11.559 --> 00:13:13.685
You know, there's your week.

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.296
There's your month.

00:13:17.518 --> 00:13:19.713
And I've taken the liberty of putting in

00:13:19.737 --> 00:13:22.737
just the five years
of elementary school sugar,

00:13:26.393 --> 00:13:27.591
just from milk.